## Indentation and Whitespace

### Indentation Rules
```csharp
// ✅ GOOD: 4 spaces per indent level
public int CalculateTotalScore()
{
    int baseScore = 0;
    foreach (var enemy in DefeatedEnemies)
    {
        if (enemy.IsBoss)
        {
            baseScore += enemy.ScoreValue * 10;
        }
        else
        {
            baseScore += enemy.ScoreValue;
        }
    }
    return baseScore;
}

// ❌ BAD: Inconsistent indentation
public int CalculateTotalScore()
{
  int baseScore = 0; // 2 spaces
    foreach (var enemy in DefeatedEnemies) // 4 spaces
       if (enemy.IsBoss) // 3 spaces
            baseScore += enemy.ScoreValue * 10; // Mixed
}
```

